+
+## Privacy and security
+
+The app serves editorial assets locally and disables third-party analytics,
+advertising, and demo credential submission. Reading-list data is optional,
+limited to article IDs, and expires after 24 hours. Users can export and delete
+it from the privacy page.
+
+See [the privacy review](docs/privacy-audit.md) for the integration inventory,
+security controls, deployment requirements, audit procedure and limitations.
+The sample session store is in memory and supports a single process only.
+
+```sh
+pnpm audit:privacy
+pnpm audit --prod
+pnpm build
+pnpm test:privacy
+```
